<section id="school-knowledge" class="sugi-card sugi-editor" data-sugi-documents data-endpoint="/admin/assistant/documents"><header class="sugi-card-heading"><div><p class="workspace-kicker">SCHOOL KNOWLEDGE</p><h2>Give Sugi the information once</h2><p>Add a handbook, campus guide or general school information. Sugi can answer different questions from it — no question-by-question setup.</p></div></header><p class="sugi-notice">Only approved institutional information. No student records, private cases or secrets. Published information follows your workspace’s visibility policy and relevant excerpts may be sent to Gemini when AI is enabled.</p><p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-doc-status>Loading school knowledge…</p><noscript>Enable JavaScript to edit school knowledge.</noscript><div class="sugi-editor-actions"><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-doc-add disabled>Add information</button><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-doc-reload>Load latest draft</button><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-doc-save disabled>Save draft</button></div><label class="sugi-document-upload">Upload a document<input type="file" accept=".pdf,.txt,.md,application/pdf,text/plain,text/markdown" data-doc-file disabled/><span>PDF, Markdown or text · up to 2 MB. Readable PDFs only; review the extracted text before publishing.</span></label><div data-doc-rows></div><div class="sugi-publish-bar"><label><input type="checkbox" data-doc-reviewed disabled/> I reviewed this information and approve its use in student help answers.</label><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-doc-publish disabled>Publish school knowledge</button></div><details><summary>Publication history</summary><ol data-doc-history></ol></details></section>
